e needed to be documented as it was before we opened it up to further chang=
e through either legislated or organic change. There were, and are concrete=
 and week thought out reasons for this which Lojbab has tried to explain re=
peatedly. He is doing this explaining and actively posing for this decision=
 to be followed as himself AND as the LLG President from then and again now=
. Doing so is part of his responsibilities in that role. I've, and I'm sure=
 others as well, sat back and followed the posts on this and related topics=
 because he was doing this. Now, obviously, I feel the need to step in. I d=
o not like seeing
